OL,3,GNEWSAChildren speak of anger at
OL,4,Alearning mum was murdered
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe children of a woman who was
OL,7,Fmurdered 28 years ago have spoken of
OL,8,Ftheir anger after growing up believing
OL,9,Ftheir mother had abandoned them.
OL,11,FPatricia Lashley, 33, a mother of
OL,12,Fseven, was last seen near her home in
OL,13,FHall Street, Dudley, in September 1998.
OL,15,FHer partner Trevor Dunkley, now 66, was
OL,16,Fjailed for life, with a minimum term of
OL,17,F10 years and 10 months, at
OL,18,FWolverhampton Crown Court on Friday,
OL,19,Fafter admitting her murder earlier this
OL,20,Fyear. Lashley's remains have never been
OL,21,Ffound.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
